## 4. Modifier keys (a change from 02)

To match vector-editor muscle memory:

| Key while dragging | Draw a box | Move | Scale | Rotate |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Shift** | square footprint | lock to the dominant world axis | keep aspect ratio | — |
| **Alt** | draw from the center | — | scale from the center | — |
| **Cmd / Ctrl** | no snap | no snap | no snap | free angle |

Snap is on by default: 0.5 m on the ground, 0.05 m vertically, **15°** for rotation. "Free" moves from `Alt` (in 02) to `Cmd/Ctrl`. On a click, `Shift` adds or removes a node from the selection.

