## 9. Editor ↔ server protocol

```
client → server  { type: "add_boxes", boxes: [BoxInput] }                        // requestId dropped (03.2)
client → server  { type: "update_nodes", changes: [{ id, ...patch }] }
client → server  { type: "remove_nodes", ids }
client → server  { type: "set_selection", ids }                                  // not an edit, like set_view
client → server  { type: "move_nodes" | "rotate_nodes" | "group_nodes" | "ungroup", ... }   // 03.7
                 (undo / redo / clear / set_view unchanged)
server → client  scene (+ history), error                                         // `created` dropped (03.2)
```

