## 11. Acceptance test (end of phase)

1. `B`: the contextual bar appears. Pick Volume + blue and draw three boxes in a row. They're blue, the selection doesn't change, and the tool stays Box.
2. `V`: click a box (the gizmo appears) and drag it by its body. It follows the cursor. With `Shift` it only moves along x or z. The red and blue arrows move it along one axis.
