9. Agent: *"move the lobby 6 m east"* is one `move_nodes` call. *"Add a pillar in its center"* is a `draw_boxes` call with `parent` set to the lobby. Select a box and ask *"make this twice as tall"*: the agent reads `selection` and calls `update_nodes`.
